WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:03.060
After arriving in the Forest Zone,

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.690
the Bagra Army, Kiriha's team,

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:08.630
and Team Twilight, Nene's team,

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:10.960
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:10.960
<b>Enemy?                          The battle begins!                      Enemy</b>

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:10.960
<b>Team Twilight  Team Kiriha                 Xros Heart(Team Taiki)</b>

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:10.960
Mysterious Girl            Rival                                                            Protagonist

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:10.960
<b>Enemy?

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:10.960
dragged us into their battle.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:19.960
<b>The Legendary Deckerdramon Stirs!</b>

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:17.070
The Legendary Deckerdramon Stirs!

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:24.090
Are you okay, Lilamon?

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:24.800
Thank you.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.650
But that black Digimon followed Stingmon

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:30.550
to the guardian deity's realm.

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:45.610
The sacred Digimon is 
at the end of that light.

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:47.190
Don't lose sight of it.

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.580
An enemy! Fight him, DarkKnightmon!

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:56.130
I don't need you giving me orders.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:58.870
I give the orders.

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:04.340
My, my...

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:13.180
What an underwhelming reception.

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:14.950
That black Digimon...

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:18.020
He's definitely a bad guy, Taiki.

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:20.490
Yeah. Nene's in danger, too. I can't—

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:22.630
You're not going to say 
"turn my back on her," are you?!

00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:24.930
No matter how you slice 
it, she's our enemy!

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.530
Look what she did to 
Lilamon and Stingmon!

00:01:27.530 --> 00:01:28.700
But still...

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:30.340
Something just seemed strange...

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:33.050
about the look in her eyes.

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:34.640
I can't turn my back on her.

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:38.460
Honestly! All you ever do is 
worry about other people!

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:40.350
I can't turn my back on her, either!

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.450
Wait for me, Ne—

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:47.120
We have to get in there somehow.

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:50.090
We're gonna go through 
there and go after Nene!

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:53.160
Kiriha!

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:55.490
Do as you please.

00:01:56.390 --> 00:02:00.230
I don't care about a girl 
who used and betrayed me.

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:03.430
There is a way.

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:14.180
You're...

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:18.220
The legendary guardian deity, 
Master Deckerdramon!

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.570
The love within you is deep.

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:24.160
I shall heal your wounds.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:27.630
The only way to prove that 
you have love within you

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:30.940
and get to Master Deckerdramon is...

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:35.330
to perform the dance of legend, 
the Love Love Dance!

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:38.140
Love Love Dance?

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:40.570
I have a very bad feeling about this.

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:42.700
Watch me. This is how it's done.

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:47.330
Love, love la lu lu!

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:49.550
Lu, love love la lu!

00:02:49.550 --> 00:02:52.750
I love you, love you, love you!

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.110
Love you, love you, love you!

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:57.990
Love, love love lu!

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:00.530
There you have it.

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:05.960
You two must complete 
this dance as a couple.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.100
As if!

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:11.510
I can't do an embarrassing 
dance like that!

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:13.770
Yeah! I told you, we're not a couple!

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:14.740
Beauty Slap!

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:16.790
You're just being shy.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:19.330
But this is no time to be embarrassed.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:22.250
This dance proves that 
you are filled with love.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:25.500
If that's the only way, 
I guess you have to do the dance.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:27.460
But I don't wanna!

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:28.720
Help us, Taiki Kudou!

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:29.620
Huh?

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:31.650
U-Uh, good luck, Zenjirou!

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:32.260
Hey!

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:34.220
This is when we need you...

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:37.160
...to not turn your back on us!

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:45.360
<i>Cooperate with me, Kiriha.</i>

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:47.790
<i>I've chosen you for that purpose.</i>

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.710
If you're having doubts, 
you should take action.

00:03:57.960 --> 00:03:59.670
What are you talking about?

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:01.550
It has nothing to do with me anymore.

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:02.820
No?

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:05.340
But, you know,

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:07.930
it's not like you to lose 
all the time, is it?

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:08.560
What?!

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:12.630
He's...

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:24.800
I won't make you guys do this alone!

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:25.980
We'll dance, too!

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:28.700
Throw your embarrassment out the window!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.280
Yeah! Let's get fired up!

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.380
<i>Why do I have to do something 
this embarrassing?</i>

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:35.890
<i>No! Nene is waiting for me!</i>

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:39.590
<i>Of all people, I had to 
get stuck with Zenjirou...</i>

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:42.260
<i>But Lilamon and Stingmon did save us.</i>

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:44.060
<i>I have no choice.</i>

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:47.430
Let's do the Love Love Dance!

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.960
Akari, we can't back out now.

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:54.210
Let's get this over with 
as quickly as possible.

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:55.230
You're right.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:55.860
Here goes!

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:01.600
Love, love love lu!

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:05.040
Lu love love la lu!

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:08.650
I love you, love you, love you!

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:10.660
Kiss, kiss, kiss!

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:13.040
Love, love love lu!

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.330
Lu love love la lu!

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:17.630
I love you, love you, love you!

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.460
Kiss, kiss, kiss!

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.000
You're both doing wonderfully!

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:24.800
Now <i>that</i>... is embarrassing.

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:31.790
I never imagined the day would come

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:34.710
when I would have to unseal your sword.

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:37.150
I agree.

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:40.050
However, I am also pleased.

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:45.660
I want to unleash this power 
upon them right away.

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:47.670
No good! No good! No good! No good!

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:48.720
No good! No good! No good!

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.360
No good! No good! No 
good! No good at all!

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:52.130
The Forest Zone is lost to us!

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:53.500
Our enemies will take control!

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:56.210
Don't say "No good" eleven times!

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.350
Aww, but isn't that 
what makes him so cute?

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:01.020
Whatever.

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:05.580
I'll go claim that Zone in Tacty's place.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:07.000
Please wait!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.560
Who are you?!

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:11.030
Kongoumon. Gaining control 
of the Forest Zone

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:12.850
is my duty as Lord 
Tactimon's subordinate.

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.800
Leave this place to me, Kongoumon!

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:17.920
Do you have a strategy in mind?

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:20.300
To invade with powerful insect Digimon,

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:23.160
the GranKuwagamon troop.

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:25.530
Might as well try it! 
You've got nothing to lose!

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.820
Yes, monsieur!

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.670
Hey, I'm not your mother.

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:31.770
Love, love love lu!

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:34.440
Wow. I'm embarrassed just watching them.

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:37.410
What are they doing at a time like this?

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:39.870
Nene...

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:41.250
Sparrowmon!

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.920
When the path opens, 
why don't you come with us?

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.650
For Nene.

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:52.310
I love you, love you, love you!

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:56.100
Love, love love lu!

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:58.400
Lu love love la lu!

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:00.570
I love you, love you, love you!

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:03.020
Love, love love lu!

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:05.350
Lu love love la lu!

00:07:07.730 --> 00:07:09.210
Is this...

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.880
I feel it. I can feel it!

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:17.880
This passion...

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:21.650
Love, love love lu!

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:25.890
It is the very embodiment 
of love for their friends!

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:35.740
You who have love within 
you, come to me!

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:36.940
We did it!

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:41.370
Master Deckerdramon has 
approved of your love!

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:43.010
We're not in love!

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:46.390
Anyway, now we can get 
to Nene and the others!

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:48.210
What's that?

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.250
The Bagra Army is attacking.

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:55.920
And there's a lot of them.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:57.070
What do we do, Taiki?

00:07:58.320 --> 00:07:59.750
I've got it!

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.230
We'll split into teams!

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:05.340
Shoutmon, Ballistamon, 
Dorulumon, Starmons, and us

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:06.760
will go after that black Digimon.

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:10.540
Then we will work with 
the Digimon of the forest

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:12.550
and hold off the Bagra Army.

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:15.870
Do you think you'll have enough 
teammates to fight him?

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.310
No problem.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:19.870
We're not the only ones going this way.

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:21.290
What does that mean?

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:23.250
Let's step on it, Taiki Kudou!

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:24.210
Right!

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:25.720
We're counting on you guys!

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:27.120
Hey!

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:29.250
All right! Let's go!

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:32.720
We're coming, too!

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:34.480
Hey!

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:39.780
W-Was that...

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:42.430
Just as Taiki said.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.870
What a strange boy that Taiki is.

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:48.110
Prepare yourselves!

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:49.870
I am Kongoumon!

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:52.080
We won't let you take one step past us!

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:07.140
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:09.660
They may be made up of data,

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:14.530
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:16.600
Join us in our world of adventure

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:20.170
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:21.240
DigiXros!

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:48.990
Who are you?

00:10:48.990 --> 00:10:52.300
The knight of darkness, DarkKnightmon.

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:56.860
Deckerdramon, we have come 
to add you to our team.

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:58.510
I-Insolence!

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:01.380
I will not let you!

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:06.940
What are you going to do 
in the shape you're in?

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:10.680
I sense no love within you.

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:12.290
I suppose not.

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:15.290
Now, come with me.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.360
You're...

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:21.730
Stingmon!

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:23.840
Thank goodness you're all right!

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:24.860
Whoa! A gator!

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:26.940
We've come to save you, Stingmon.

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:29.770
And you, too, Nene.

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:33.590
DarkKnightmon is just using 
you for something, right?

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:39.600
Good insight, Taiki Kudou.

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:41.780
You've got the right idea.

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:44.420
But what if I am?

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.990
I'll make you pay for hurting her!

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:49.420
What he said!

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.020
Shoutmon!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.090
Okay!

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:53.830
Ballistamon!

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:56.040
Dorulumon!

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:57.730
Starmons!

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:59.060
Yes!

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:00.570
DigiXros!

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:02.180
DigiXros!

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:06.240
Shoutmon X4!

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:13.340
What great love this boy possesses...

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:15.980
Please, don't make me laugh.

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:18.180
Danger! Danger!

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:19.350
Nene!

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:20.810
Excuse me...

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:22.940
Go slower, please!

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:33.130
You think that will be 
enough to defeat me?

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:42.470
Greymon!

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:43.780
What's he doing here?!

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.740
Blaster Tail!

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:52.620
Greymon!

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:54.790
MailBirdramon!

00:12:56.490 --> 00:12:57.860
DigiXros!

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:00.580
MetalGreymon!

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:01.930
Kiriha!

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:05.560
You were right, Taiki.

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:08.600
Losing all the time isn't my style.

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:10.270
You see?

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:12.240
I thought you'd say that!

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:15.490
Wh-What?

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:16.710
What is all this?

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:19.540
Taiki and...

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.080
Kiriha have...

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:28.590
...joined forces?!

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:40.330
Nene.

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:42.220
Use Xros Open.

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:43.670
But...

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:46.440
That is an order.

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:57.260
Xros Open!

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:06.760
What?!

00:14:15.150 --> 00:14:19.480
This is my true form, SkullKnightmon.

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:23.710
And this is my partner, DeadlyAxemon.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:27.110
DarkKnightmon was a DigiXros?!

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:31.680
Nene.

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:32.950
DigiXros!

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:37.790
Big Axe Mode!

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:53.740
Surrender now, Deckerdramon.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.460
I am a guardian deity of love.

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:59.270
I can see the love in any fighter.

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:02.590
I will not cooperate 
with that black knight.

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:06.220
However, if you ask me 
to join you alone...

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:07.320
Quiet!

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:09.350
Nene.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:11.320
DigiXros me.

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:15.330
DigiXr—

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:17.700
Don't do it, Nene!

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:22.800
Taiki, don't interfere.

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:24.270
Make it quick.

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:28.440
Do you not care what happens 
to the one you care about?

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:35.050
What is he threatening you with?

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:37.600
Tell me! Please, Nene!

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:38.720
Stop!

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:42.410
Don't look at me like that...

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:43.190
Yuu!

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:51.000
Who is Yuu?

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:55.330
My younger brother.

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:02.240
And he's the reason you 
listen to DarkKnightmon?

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:04.140
DigiXros!

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:07.140
Nene!

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:08.010
Leave me alone!

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:09.850
This is not your concern!

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:13.730
All I want is to go back to 
the human world with Yuu!

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:16.030
If he can make that happen,

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:18.060
I don't care if he's a demon!

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:19.720
Nene!

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:21.660
That's awful... Nene...

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.490
<i>She wants to go home?</i>

00:16:23.490 --> 00:16:25.230
<i>Just like me...</i>

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:29.670
I understand now.

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:31.530
Kiriha...

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:36.920
I mistakenly thought you were 
only acting for your own gains.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:40.080
If that's the case, 
then get stronger, Nene.

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:42.780
Like I did.

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:45.450
Only strength can cure sadness!

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:56.260
This feeling...

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:00.600
We are Blue Flare.

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:03.300
We'll show you our flame 
that burns bright blue!

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:07.670
I will not yield.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:17.110
I will change the entire 
Digital World...

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:18.320
with my own strength!

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:21.150
Nene, are you okay?

00:17:23.840 --> 00:17:26.120
What's going on, Mr. Gator?!

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:31.150
Stingmon, I entrust this land to you.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.870
What? Then what will you do?

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:36.430
The one I am to protect has appeared.

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:42.000
A Code Crown?

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:47.810
Why are you helping me?

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:52.650
You are the one who possesses 
the strongest love.

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:54.430
Me?

00:17:54.430 --> 00:17:57.550
From now on, 
I will fight by your side...

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:59.820
in your battle of love.

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:05.700
If you're not strong, 
you're not qualified to join me.

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:08.880
Show me your strength, Deckerdramon!

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:10.440
Very well.

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:13.520
Hey! The gator teamed up with Kiriha!

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:14.790
What a <i>croc</i>!

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:17.180
Sounds good to me.

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:19.910
Shoutmon X4! Use your vulcans!

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:20.280
Right!

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:23.450
Finish this, Blue Flare!

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:27.250
Giga Destroyer!

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.320
Deckerdra-Launcher!

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:40.350
Did they get him?!

00:18:45.320 --> 00:18:48.040
I'd expect no less of the boy 
who caught Nene's eye.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:50.080
Kiriha Aonuma...

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:54.380
If you will gather Digimon 
and Code Crowns for me,

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:56.490
I have no problem with you.

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:59.150
Time to retreat, Nene.

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:01.490
I understand, DarkKnightmon.

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:03.490
Nene! Don't go with him!

00:19:04.470 --> 00:19:05.880
Change Zone.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:09.790
Let's go back to the Dust Zone.

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:10.760
Nene!

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:12.920
Leave Nene to me!

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.010
Kiriha!

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:18.200
Let's get back to the others!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:20.990
Beelzebumon!

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:23.840
Starmons!

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:25.210
Yes!

00:19:25.210 --> 00:19:26.810
DigiXros!

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:31.150
Meteor Cannon!

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:40.860
It can't be!

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:44.090
You'd better remember my name!

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:46.430
It's Kongoumon!

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:54.540
Thank you, Taiki.

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:56.870
I'll never forget you all.

00:19:56.870 --> 00:20:01.150
I'll never forget that 
love dance, either.

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:05.850
You're going to save Nene next, right?

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:09.020
What am I gonna do with you?

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:10.190
Let's get moving.

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:12.760
Yeah!

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:15.470
Nene wants our help.

00:20:15.470 --> 00:20:18.070
She intentionally gave me a hint.

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:19.760
She said "Dust Zone."

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:22.030
I've been there before.

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:23.300
You have?

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:25.330
If you keep me in your Xros Loader,

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:27.620
we should be able to backtrack 
through my log to get there.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.440
All right! Let's go, guys!

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:31.440
We're praying for your good fortune!

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:39.280
Dorulumon, how long does it 
take to get to the Dust Zone?

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:42.120
I don't think it's very far from here.

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:46.890
Taiki!

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:54.680
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:58.200
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:58.200
Digimon Data Collection!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:02.140
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:02.140
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:20:59.140 --> 00:21:00.140
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:01.140
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:21:01.140 --> 00:21:02.140
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:14.530
<b>[Type]</b>

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:14.540
<b>Insect Type</b>

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:14.540
<b>[Attacks]</b>

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:14.530
<b>Blackout
Poison Pierce</b>

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:13.530
He has the slim physique of a model!

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:14.550
Lucky!

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:18.020
The place where all the drifters 
end up, the Dust Zone.

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:21.030
Sounds like GrandLocomon is 
forcing his reign upon everyone.

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:22.120
We've gotta do something to help!

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:25.800
While you were saying that, 
the Xros Loader was stolen!

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:27.070
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:29.380
<b>Dust Zone, GrandLocomon's</b>

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:28.740
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:29.380
<b>Great Scrap City!</b>
